  m_text: "1. Tap to drop a block and build your tower as high as possible. \n2.
    Each successfully placed block counts as 1 point. \n3. Try to place every block
    exactly in the center of the one below \u2014 if you place it too far left or
    right, the tower will start leaning. \n4. The more the tower leans, the easier
    it is to collapse. \n5. The game ends when the tower falls."
